  "title": "VINFAST LAUNCHES VF 2, A COMPACT CITY CAR PRICED AT VND 188 MILLION",
  "summary": "Hanoi, July 5, 2026 – VinFast officially unveiled the VF 2, a strategic electric vehicle model designed to make car ownership more accessible for Vietnamese consumers. Priced at just VND 188 million (including the battery), the two-door, four-seat city car offers a safe and comfortable alternative to motorcycles, helping improve the quality of urban life.",
